window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Leander:</p> <p>The woman with my twin babies in her belly ran. Again.</p> <p>I want to chase her and tie her to the bed. Again.</p> <p>I’ll make sure she enjoys it.</p> <p>Truth is, I feel more and more like a caveman every day I go without seeing her face.</p> <p>This sh#t’s instinctual.</p> <p>She’s carrying my babies. So I want her in my cave.</p> <p>I want to go hunt sh#t, kill it, and wrap her in my furs.</p> <p>I’m trying to be a better man, though. To like…listen and s#it. Do things the right way.</p> <p>Not sure it’s in my nature.</p> <p>But I’ll do whatever it takes to bring my woman home.</p>"; 
